## 1. Design Tokens & Components

### 1.1 Colors (ShadCN tokens)

- Primary CTAs, progress fills: `bg-primary`, `text-primary-foreground`
- Muted surfaces: `bg-muted`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`
- Success state (activated): re-use `bg-primary` or introduce `--success` (`emerald-500` equivalent)
- Destructive (expired/failed): `bg-destructive`, `text-destructive-foreground`

### 1.2 Core Components to Use/Re-skin

- `Card`, `Badge`, `Progress`, `Tabs`, `Accordion`, `Table`, `ScrollArea`, `Dialog`, `Sheet`, `Popover`, `HoverCard`, `Command` (for Combobox)
- Icons: lucide-react (`AlarmClock`, `Share2`, `Bell`, `CheckCircle2`, `XCircle`…)

