## 7. API Endpoints (pseudo)

```
GET  /api/regions                         -> Region[]
GET  /api/regions/:code                   -> Region
GET  /api/campaigns/:id                   -> Campaign
POST /api/campaigns                       -> create campaign
POST /api/campaigns/:id/updates           -> new update
POST /api/campaigns/:id/comments          -> new comment
POST /api/stake                           -> stake control (body: wallet, region, amount)
POST /api/solar-farms                     -> register farm
POST /api/installers/apply                -> apply to certify
```

