## 8. Accessibility & Semantics

- Use semantic headings (`h1` for page title, `h2` for section headers).
- `Progress` has ARIA attributes.
- Countdown has `aria-live="polite"` text.
- Region cards are links with full click area.
- Color contrast: ensure progress bars + badges pass WCAG AA.

