## 10. Mapping to Backend Spec (v1.5)

- Region status & criteria values come from `region_status`, `GCTL_stakes`, `solar_farms` tables (see provided SQL).
- Activation thresholds pulled from constants or Foundation-configured values.
- A region is “Active” when `active_flag = true` OR `region_activation_events.activated = true`.
- “Kickstarting” when campaign exists and `activated = false` and `deadline > now()`.
- “Failed” when campaign exists, `activated = false`, `deadline < now()`.

